e can set\n<MATH_0051>\nso that we obtain the following diagram\n<MATH_0052>\nwith exact rows which shows that <MATH_0053>. Conversely, if\n<MATH_0054> exists, then the pushout of <MATH_0055> by the map\n<MATH_0056> is isomorphic to <MATH_0057> by\nLemma <REF_0005> and the vanishing of higher ext groups\ninto the injective module <MATH_0058>. This gives a diagram\nas above, which implies that <MATH_0059> is split as an extension, i.e.,\nthe class <MATH_0060> is zero.\n<STRUCT_0004>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5656aaa2e741df364f7105d91a2b748f3329c0390cbcacb26d3b2efa33d63c91", "unit_id": "inventory:defos:08MF:proof/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "locked-English-neighbor:defos:inventory:defos:08MG:remark/0001", "hash": "sha256:ee660fc1ef9dd82db4d026189880f0fa3ffebbd6e1e9fc4674f6dad303b433e7", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 106521, "byte_start": 105536, "file": "defos.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:394378b45edc24e7516dedb621ae64742b2f5afc3447af77aa09c421c7f66aa8", "line_end": 2882, "line_start": 2862}, "owner_tag": "08MG", "parent_tag": "08MA", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "defos", "node_kind": "remark", "parent_tag": "08MA", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{remark-trivial-thickening-ringed-topoi}", "MATH_0001": "$(\\Sh(\\mathcal{C}), \\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0002": "$i : (\\Sh(\\mathcal{C}), \\mathcal{O}) \\to\n(\\Sh(\\mathcal{D}), \\mathcal{O}')$", "MATH_0003": "$\\pi : (\\Sh(\\mathcal{D}), \\mathcal{O}') \\to (\\Sh(\\mathcal{C}), \\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0004": "$i$", "MATH_0005": "$\\pi$", "MATH_0006": "$\\pi$", "MATH_0007": "\\begin{equation}\n\\label{equation-splitting-ringed-topoi}\n\\mathcal{O}' = \\mathcal{O} \\oplus \\mathcal{I}\n\\end{equation}", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0009": "$\\pi^\\sharp$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{O}' \\to \\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0011": "$\\pi$", "MATH_0012": "$(\\Sh(\\mathcal{C}), \\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "